WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.166
What happens when 800 of the world's most elite footballers...

00:00:03.166 --> 00:00:06.083
and their managers live together under one roof?

00:00:06.083 --> 00:00:07.583
Players stop being polite...

00:00:07.583 --> 00:00:09.750
and start getting Re-al.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.666
This is...

00:00:10.666 --> 00:00:11.958
The Champions.

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:15.250
I am so sick of all the vanity and the egos in Paris.

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.500
That is why next season, I'm going to Miami.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.291
If you come at Napoli, be prepared to get a pizza me...

00:00:21.291 --> 00:00:24.666
Ever since I was a young boy, I dreamed of playing for Juv...

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:25.958
Piemonte Calcio

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:30.125
And just remember, don't overlook Olympiacos!

00:00:42.916 --> 00:00:45.291
A red card this early in the morning?

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:47.541
I didn’t realize the refs could see into my dreams.

00:00:47.541 --> 00:00:49.625
I'm afraid It’s not that kind of red card...

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:50.666
...it’s worse.

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:52.083
Aye yai yai.

00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:56.083
So every year, the winner of the Champions League hosts a ball in their honor.

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:59.791
I can say from experience, it’s usually not very fun for the losers. 

00:00:59.791 --> 00:01:03.083
But this year is different, because everybody loves Liverpool!

00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:05.625
I can feel the excitement all over the house! 

00:01:16.458 --> 00:01:17.583
I'm not going.

00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:19.291
Bup-bup, Razz, we have to go. 

00:01:19.291 --> 00:01:24.333
We have to show them that we can handle anything they throw at us...even a…a...

00:01:24.333 --> 00:01:26.333
An insufferable Liverpool wankfest?

00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:30.291
Yes…even an insufferable Liverpool wankfest.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:39.458
The festivities are about to begin, so please take your seats.

00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.750
What's this, we've got no silverware? 

00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:47.083
Barcelona, we didn’t mean to put you front and center,

00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:50.375
but unfortunately, all the corners were taken too quickly!

00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:54.250
Before we begin, I want to thank a special person,

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:58.500
without whom we would not be here today, Mr. Loris Karius.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:01.041
Thank you for showing our American overlords the importance

00:02:01.041 --> 00:02:03.458
of spending a lot of money on a competent keeper.

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.750
Well, we’ve got some special treats for you tonight, folks.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.791
Liverpool greats, old and new,

00:02:10.791 --> 00:02:15.500
will share with us their favorite memories and what this title means to them.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.875
First up, Captain Fantastic himself, Steven Gerrard!

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:27.625
Yikes. OK. Well, next up is, Robbie Fowler!

00:02:29.375 --> 00:02:33.541
Moving on now to number 38 of me top 50 list

00:02:33.541 --> 00:02:37.333
of Liverpool inside jokes that only true scousers would understand...

00:02:37.333 --> 00:02:41.000
...In the Netherlands, we have a saying, “Je staat nooit alleen,”

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.416
or in English...you’ll never walk alone.

00:02:43.416 --> 00:02:46.958
And that is why we need more Liverpool players in the media!

00:02:46.958 --> 00:02:48.458
We should never have to talk alone. 

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.833
Bleedin’ hell. Seriously, we can’t just leave?

00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:55.166
No! We must stay. Because when we win this year…

00:02:55.166 --> 00:02:56.666
then they must stay.

00:02:56.916 --> 00:02:58.125
Kevin.

00:02:58.125 --> 00:03:02.416
And then there was the 2005 Champions League semi-final against Chelsea.

00:03:02.416 --> 00:03:05.416
What’s the matter, Lampard? You look like you’ve seen a ghost.

00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:08.416
Ugh, Liverpool. Such bloody wankers, am I right?

00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:10.750
And now, we’d like to play a special video,

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.000
to show you why in Liverpool, this means more.

00:03:14.666 --> 00:03:18.375
Welcome to Liverpool, where everything matters a little more.

00:03:18.916 --> 00:03:22.416
Other teams have supporters. We have a family.

00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:27.083
Other teams have managers. We have a guardian angel with perfect teeth.

00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:31.250
We are the most special team, in the most special city,

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:35.708
with the most fun, likeable players and and the catchiest songs.

00:03:35.708 --> 00:03:38.166
We are Liverpool...

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:41.708
This means more. Your team means less.

00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:45.541
Please give me a red card! I’ll do anything! Anything!

00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:46.625
Just please eject me, man!

00:03:46.625 --> 00:03:48.250
And now you’re all very lucky.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.041
'Cause we’ve got a very special musical guest,

00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:54.583
a legendary Liverpool musician...

00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:55.958
Let’s give it up for...

00:03:55.958 --> 00:03:58.750
Jamie Webster!

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.916
Who the hell is Jamie Webster?

00:04:00.916 --> 00:04:02.750
You don't know Jamie Webster?

00:04:02.750 --> 00:04:07.750
Mo Salah, Mo Salah, my heart is full of Liverpool,

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.500
and if I die, I hope I go to heaven,

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:15.666
and heaven is actually Anfield, and god is Robbie Fowler.

00:04:15.666 --> 00:04:20.041
Mo Salah, Mo Salah, I love you so much I would eat your poop.

00:04:20.041 --> 00:04:23.041
Oh, come on. This is painful. Everyone else is leaving.

00:04:23.041 --> 00:04:25.375
Yes. But we’re not like everyone, Razza.

00:04:25.375 --> 00:04:28.041
Remain classy. Don’t let them break you.

00:04:28.041 --> 00:04:30.666
Wow...that was truly unbelievable.

00:04:30.666 --> 00:04:35.625
And now, I want to do a toast, to the incredible feat of winning the Champions League,

00:04:35.625 --> 00:04:38.708
and doing so without spending all the money that Manchester City spends,

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.916
oh my god it’s like a fantasy land over there..am I right?

00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:43.916
So let’s all raise our cups!

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:49.000
Ah. Is there is anything sweeter than drinking from Ol’ Big Ears?

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.583
I can think of one thing.

00:04:51.583 --> 00:04:56.625
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha! Drinking from the Premier League trophy!

00:04:56.625 --> 00:04:58.791
But, of course, Liverpool wouldn’t know.

00:04:58.791 --> 00:05:01.041
Whoa. He hasn't looked at the table, has he?

00:05:01.041 --> 00:05:03.166
Seriously. So self-absorbed.

00:05:03.166 --> 00:05:05.333
No wonder everyone hates Man City.

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:29.625
Hey, what's up, YouTube?

00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:31.500
Hit subscribe to support The Champions,

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:35.041
and you'll instantly be more committed to B/R Football than I am to Tottenham.

